      <activity id="34a3f06c-5c35-55a1-836c-582b0aa14824" activityNameId="7d51ca89-fc43-5f56-a22e-9b87c47f277d" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Tap water, unspecified natural origin RER, at user</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Tap water, unspecified natural origin RER, at user
Rough estimation investigated for CH and data for energy use in DE.;
Formula: H2O; 
UUID: b46df10f-1cc2-36da-970f-61a693f21206
Infrastructure and energy use for water treatment and transportation to the end user. No emissions from water treatment. Water flows adapted with new elementary flows for water balance.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Example of a water works in CH.
Time period: Time of publication.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature. 
Extrapolations: From CH and DE to RER situation. Share of resource uses (ground and surface water) estimated.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b46df10f-1cc2-36da-970f-61a693f21206.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
